WEBVTT

00:01.600 --> 00:06.760
A nobody not worth mentioning I'll remember your face.

00:07.080 --> 00:08.480
Retreat.

00:24.400 --> 00:30.040
Brothers pursue with all our might leave none alive wait Chen Ying.

00:30.120 --> 00:31.440
You still want to stop us?

00:31.520 --> 00:34.760
I've already given you all my military merit completely you dare go back on your word.

00:34.840 --> 00:35.880
General Zu.

00:35.960 --> 00:41.680
I only promised to hold Yiyang pursuing the Wuzhao is too risky all soldiers.

00:42.120 --> 00:47.360
The Wuzhao trampled the central plains oppressed our people if we let the Wuzhao return north.

00:47.440 --> 00:52.480
Next time those who suffer may be your families and friends.

00:52.640 --> 00:56.400
Sons of Xuan how can we endure such humiliation?

00:56.600 --> 01:02.160
Northern volunteers still dare to fight to the death those with courage follow me and kill.

01:02.280 --> 01:04.640
Without my order no one moves.

01:07.520 --> 01:09.040
Kill.

01:12.960 --> 01:15.080
Kill.

01:32.480 --> 01:33.880
The sun sets.

01:34.560 --> 01:38.560
Liu Dadao, at some point was pierced by a spear.

01:38.920 --> 01:41.640
Kneeling backward in the sunset.

01:42.920 --> 01:46.960
On both sides of him xuan's iron cavalry thundered past.

01:47.560 --> 01:52.600
He gazed at the pink sky finally released the blade in his hand.

01:54.160 --> 01:56.880
Facing death who isn't afraid?

01:56.960 --> 01:58.480
Who isn't a coward?

02:00.000 --> 02:03.800
But there are always some beliefs that can support.

02:04.040 --> 02:06.160
A coward's backbone.

02:13.040 --> 02:14.440
Liu.

02:16.840 --> 02:21.360
Liu liu Nian I, Sikong Yao, swear.

02:22.360 --> 02:26.880
I will protect her warm clothes and full bellies peace and happiness.

02:30.000 --> 02:31.400
General Liu.

02:32.480 --> 02:33.880
You and the brothers.

02:35.120 --> 02:36.520
Rest assured.

03:21.760 --> 03:26.480
The imperial physicians said not to get too emotional Your head condition.

03:26.560 --> 03:31.800
Needs rest those physicians know nothing the Daoist masters said.

03:32.080 --> 03:36.840
Three disasters, nine hardships, ten trials must pass through to achieve immortality.

03:51.320 --> 03:54.080
Born born how is it?

03:54.240 --> 03:57.720
Congratulations, Your Majesty congratulations, Empress it's a son.

03:58.960 --> 04:04.520
Good I will richly reward the Xie family let's go I want to see my grandson.

04:10.080 --> 04:12.120
Look at him he's smiling, he's smiling.

04:13.600 --> 04:19.040
His eyes are like his father's His nose takes after me.

04:21.760 --> 04:25.400
This is the eldest grandson Your Majesty should give him a name.

04:26.240 --> 04:30.760
Good sheng call him.

04:30.840 --> 04:32.440
Sikong Sheng.

04:33.960 --> 04:39.360
Father is wise sheng is for the great victory in the north.

04:39.440 --> 04:43.000
Is for the north-south canal soon to be opened for prosperity.

04:43.880 --> 04:48.160
Is from heaven blessing Great Xuan's flourishing fortune.

04:50.040 --> 04:52.000
We have a good daughter-in-law.

04:54.960 --> 04:57.720
Sheng'er sheng'er sheng'er.

